	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nRussell Peters: RELAX World Tour LIVE at Encore Th
	eater at Wynn Las Vegas\nComedy legend Russell Peters returns to the Encor
	e Theater at Wynn Las Vegas with his hilarious RELAX World Tour — *It’s No
	t That Serious — for two exclusive performances on August 21 and 22\, 2026
	. One of the world’s most successful stand-up comedians\, Peters brings hi
	s signature multicultural humor and razor-sharp wit to one of Las Vegas’s 
	most prestigious comedy stages. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 21\
	, 2026 (also Saturday\, August 22)\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nVenue: Encore Theate
	r at Wynn Las Vegas\nAddress: 3131 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109
	\nAge Requirement: 18+ Event \nAbout Russell Peters\nRussell Peters is one
	 of the most successful stand-up comedians in the world\, known for his sh
	arp multicultural observations and high-energy performances. A Las Vegas r
	esident\, Peters has sold out arenas across six continents and has multipl
	e Netflix specials to his name. His RELAX World Tour continues his traditi
	on of delivering laugh-out-loud comedy that resonates with audiences every
	where. \nWhat to Expect\n\nWorld-class stand-up comedy from a global super
	star\nSharp multicultural humor and observational comedy\nHigh-energy perf
	ormance in an intimate theater setting\nTwo exclusive Las Vegas performanc
	es only\nPremium theater experience at the iconic Wynn Las Vegas\nApproxim
	ately 90 minutes of entertainment\n\nVenue Information\nThe Encore Theater
	 at Wynn Las Vegas is one of the most prestigious entertainment venues on 
	the Strip\, known for hosting world-class comedy and music acts in an inti
	mate\, luxurious setting. Located inside the award-winning Wynn Las Vegas 
	resort\, the theater offers exceptional sightlines and premium amenities. 
	\nTicket Information\nTickets range from approximately $75 to $150. This i
	s an 18+ event. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or V
	ividSeats (resale). The median ticket price is approximately $126. \nOffic
	ial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn 
	a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to
	 you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID 
	may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/russell-pet
	ers-relax-world-tour-live-at-encore-theater-at-wynn-las-vegas/\n\nFrom Com
