SUMMARY:Steve Treviño LIVE at Grand Sierra Resort and Casino
DTSTAMP:20260822T032651Z
DTSTART:20260821T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n \nThis post contains affiliate
	 links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Steve Tr
	eviño\nSteve Treviño is one of the hottest stand-up comedians in the count
	ry\, celebrated for his relatable\, family-friendly humor rooted in his Me
	xican-American upbringing in South Texas. His comedy resonates deeply with
	 audiences across all backgrounds\, blending sharp cultural observations w
	ith heartfelt storytelling. \nTreviño has released multiple comedy special
	s\, including Relatable\, Til Death\, Grandpa Joe’s Son\, and Steve Treviñ
	o: Adulting\, all of which have earned him a massive and loyal fanbase. Hi
	s specials are available on major streaming platforms and have been praise
	d for their warmth\, authenticity\, and laugh-out-loud humor. \nKnown for 
	his stories about marriage\, family\, and growing up Latino in America\, S
	teve Treviño brings a unique voice to the comedy world that is both hilari
	ous and deeply human. Fans can expect a high-energy performance filled wit
	h personal anecdotes\, crowd interaction\, and the kind of comedy that mak
	es you laugh until your sides hurt. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August
	 21\, 2026 \nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open approximately 7:00 PM) \nVenue: Gra
	nd Sierra Resort and Casino (Grand Theatre) — 2500 East Second Street\, Re
	no\, NV 89595 \nShow Duration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAge Restriction:
	 All ages welcome\; some adult content — parental discretion advised \nAbo
	ut the Venue\nThe Grand Theatre at Grand Sierra Resort is Reno’s premier d
	estination for world-class entertainment. Located at 2500 East Second Stre
	et\, the Grand Sierra Resort and Casino is one of the largest resort prope
	rties in Northern Nevada\, offering a full entertainment complex with a ho
	tel\, casino\, restaurants\, and live event spaces. \nThe Grand Theatre se
	ats approximately 1\,600 guests and is known for its intimate atmosphere\,
	 excellent acoustics\, and comfortable seating. The venue has hosted some 
	of the biggest names in comedy\, music\, and entertainment\, making it one
	 of the most sought-after performance spaces in the Reno-Tahoe region. \nA
	mple parking is available on-site at the Grand Sierra Resort\, and the ven
	ue is conveniently located just minutes from downtown Reno and the Reno-Ta
	hoe International Airport. Guests are encouraged to arrive early to enjoy 
	the resort’s dining and casino amenities before the show. \nWhat to Expect
	\nSteve Treviño’s live show is a solo stand-up performance packed with his
	 signature blend of family humor\, cultural comedy\, and personal storytel
	ling. Expect a warm\, engaging performance that connects with audiences of
	 all ages and backgrounds. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes with n
	o intermission. Steve Treviño is known for his ability to work the crowd a
	nd make every audience member feel like part of the show. Whether you’re a
	 longtime fan or discovering him for the first time\, this is a night of c
	omedy you won’t forget. \nPlan to arrive at least 30 minutes before showti
	me to find your seats and settle in. The Grand Theatre fills up quickly fo
	r popular comedy events\, so early arrival is recommended. \nTicket Inform
