SUMMARY:Marc Maron: Yammering into the Void Tour LIVE at California Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260822T032651Z
DTSTART:20260822T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Marc Maron\nMarc Maro
	n is one of the most respected voices in stand-up comedy. The Brooklyn-bor
	n comedian\, actor\, and podcast host is best known for his groundbreaking
	 WTF with Marc Maron podcast\, which has featured interviews with Presiden
	t Barack Obama and the biggest names in entertainment. \nMaron’s stand-up 
	is deeply personal\, introspective\, and brutally honest. His comedy explo
	res anxiety\, relationships\, addiction\, aging\, and the existential absu
	rdity of modern life. His Yammering into the Void Tour promises his most c
	andid and compelling material yet. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, Aug
	ust 22\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: California Th
	eatre\, 345 S First St\, San Jose\, CA 95113\nContent Warning: Adult langu
	age and themes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe California Theatre is one of San Jo
	se’s most beloved historic performance venues. Built in 1927\, this stunni
	ng Spanish Colonial Revival-style theater has been beautifully restored an
	d seats approximately 1\,100 guests. It is operated by San Jose Theaters a
	nd is a designated San Jose landmark. \nThe intimate yet grand atmosphere 
	of the California Theatre makes it an ideal setting for a comedian of Maro
	n’s caliber. The venue features excellent acoustics\, comfortable seating\
	, and a beautiful interior. Located at 345 S First St in downtown San Jose
	\, it is easily accessible by public transit and nearby parking. \nWhat to
	 Expect\nMarc Maron’s live shows are known for their intensity\, vulnerabi
	lity\, and sharp comedic insight. Expect a full evening of stand-up that g
	oes deep — Maron doesn’t shy away from difficult topics\, but always finds
	 the humor in the darkness. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes. This
	 is a must-see for fans of intelligent\, emotionally resonant comedy in on
	e of San Jose’s most beautiful venues. \nTicket Information\nTickets are p
	riced from approximately $45 – $95 depending on seating and availability. 
	\n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links
	. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no ext
	ra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid
	 photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/m
	arc-maron-yammering-into-the-void-tour-live-at-california-theatre/\n\nFrom
	 Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/marc-maron-yammering-into-the-void-tou
	r-live-at-california-theatre/
LOCATION:California Theatre\, 345 S First St\, San Jose\, California\, 9511
	3\, United States
